Hi <%= @user.name %>,

A new event has been scheduled on your calendar!

Event Details:
Title: <%= @event.title %>
<% if @event.description.present? %>Description: <%= @event.description %><% end %>
<% user_tz = @user.timezone || 'UTC' %>
<% start_in_tz = @event.start_time.in_time_zone(user_tz) %>
<% end_in_tz = @event.end_time.in_time_zone(user_tz) %>
Date & Time: <%= start_in_tz.strftime('%A, %B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %> <%= start_in_tz.strftime('%Z') %>
End Time: <%= end_in_tz.strftime('%I:%M %p') %>

Client Information:
Name: <%= @client.name %>
Email: <%= @client.email %>
<% if @client.phone.present? %>Phone: <%= @client.phone %><% end %>

The event has been added to the attached calendar file (event.ics). You can import this into your calendar application.

A confirmation has been sent to <%= @client.email %><% if @client.phone.present? %> and <%= @client.phone %><% end %>.
